    "text": "顺路。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_808.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 816,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "要不要上来坐一会儿？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_816.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 818,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……下次吧。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_818.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 823,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "顺路。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_823.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 859,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "老板，昨晚谁送你回来的？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_859.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 860,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "顺路。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_860.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 861,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "哦——",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_861.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 866,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "老板，昨晚谁送你回来的？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_866.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 867,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "顺路。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_867.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 868,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "哦——",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_868.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 904,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "楼要卖了。新房东要重新签，租金按市价。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_904.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 905,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……多少？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_905.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 910,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "我也不想涨。可新房东按合同来，我也没办法。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_910.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 911,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……期限呢？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_911.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 912,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "下个月十五号之前。签了，就按新价；不签，十五号之后腾房。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_912.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 914,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "小沈，你这店开了几年了？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_914.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 915,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "三年。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_915.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 916,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "嗯。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_916.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 925,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "十五号之前把第一笔打过来就行。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_925.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 929,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "行。十五号之前给我个准话。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_929.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 940,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "老板。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_940.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 941,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "嗯？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_941.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 942,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……没事。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_942.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 952,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "差多少？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_952.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 953,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……不用你管。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_953.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 954,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "我问差多少。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_954.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 962,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "房东最近来过吗？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_962.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 963,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……怎么突然问这个？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_963.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 964,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "随便问问。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_964.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1017,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……你怎么在这？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1017.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1018,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "这是我想问的。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1018.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1031,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "昨晚……谢谢你。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1031.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1032,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "谢什么？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1032.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1033,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……外套。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1033.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1064,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "在写什么？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1064.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1065,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "秘密。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1065.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1076,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……我妈。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1076.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1080,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……嗯，在上班。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1080.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1081,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "不是玩，是工作。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1081.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1082,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……我知道。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1082.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1083,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "妈，我会想的。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1083.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1088,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "我妈说，让我回老家考编。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1088.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1089,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……你怎么说？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1089.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1090,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "我说我再干一年。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1090.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1092,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "老板，我是不是很没出息？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1092.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1097,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "不会。你比我认真。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1097.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1099,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……真的？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1099.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1100,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "本子都记了小半本了。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1100.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1103,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "你妈说得也有道理。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1103.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1105,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……嗯。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1105.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1108,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "老板。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1108.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1109,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "嗯？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1109.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1110,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "如果有一天你不想开了，我可以当店长。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1110.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1117,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……店可能要关了。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1117.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1119,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "什么时候的事？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1119.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1120,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "下个月十五号之前。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1120.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1121,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "……那你刚才还让我当店长。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1121.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1136,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……嗯。找到了。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1136.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1138,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "那挺好的。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1138.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1141,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "房东最近来过吗？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1141.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1143,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……随便问问。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1143.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1191,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "这行划掉的是什么？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1191.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1193,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……写错了。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1193.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1208,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "老板，这书挺好看的。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1208.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1249,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "陆哥，如果有一天老板不想开了，我可以当店长。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1249.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1263,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "陆哥，听说你找到工作了？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1263.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1264,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……嗯。找到了。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1264.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1271,
    "speaker": "xiaoman",
    "text": "那挺好的。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1271.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1275,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "房东最近来过吗？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1275.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1276,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "……怎么突然问这个？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1276.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1277,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "随便问问。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1277.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1298,
    "speaker": "landlord",
    "text": "十五号之前把第一笔打过来就行。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1298.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1350,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……我没睡。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1350.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1352,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "你什么时候醒的？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1352.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1353,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "你进门的时候。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1353.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1355,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "别哭。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1355.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1368,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "昨晚……谢谢你。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1368.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1369,
    "speaker": "shenlan",
    "text": "谢什么？",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1369.ogg"
  },
  {
    "file": "story_mid.rpy",
    "line": 1370,
    "speaker": "luyao",
    "text": "……外套。",
    "audio": "audio/voice/story_mid_1370.ogg"
  }
]